[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25449.03, "timestamp": "07:04:09", "text": "這傢伙為什麼不工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25475.6, "timestamp": "07:04:35", "text": "嗯？你跑的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25483.31, "timestamp": "07:04:43", "text": "那座橋在哪裡？你要往哪裡跑？哦，等等。必須這麼做。我的天哪。我需要重啟。技術故障。沒關係。  [音樂] 嗯，好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25486.15, "timestamp": "07:04:46", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25490.548, "timestamp": "07:04:50", "text": "讓我來做[音樂]"}]